    "title": "The Scale Forum for Youth Entrepreneurship Comes to Tanzania",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "On September 28th in Dar es Salaam the Civil Society Initiative, a joint programme of the Aga Khan University (AKU) and the Aga Khan Foundation in East Africa (AKFEA), held the second in its series of Scale forums across East Africa.",
    "media": [
